              "props": {
                "span": 12
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "about-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Careers at Rechtien Truck Group.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "eyebrow": "Build a career here"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "about-t1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Carolina International Trucks is the largest commercial truck dealer in South Carolina, providing a statewide presence of sales, service and support for medium, heavy and severe-service International trucks. We also sell and service IC Bus vehicles, Hino trucks and Mitsubishi Fuso medium duty commercial work trucks. To support customer uptime, Carolina International Trucks has over $5 million in stocked parts and a state-of-the-art paint booth and body shop in Columbia. Carolina Idealease provides short-term and long-term solutions through truck leasing, rental and mobile maintenance support.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "about-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien International Trucks serves South Florida from five locations: Miami, Ft. Lauderdale, Riviera Beach, Fort Pierce and Fort Myers. Together, Rechtien Truck Group has more than 270 employees across South Florida and South Carolina.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "about-t3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We offer multiple incentive plans, a tool certification program and more. Our comprehensive benefits plan includes health, dental and vision insurance, 401(k) with company match, paid holidays, vacation and personal days.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
